@@title SQ-CEN Creative Engineering carve and the creativecommon swap, 2026-11-04 ([creative_engineering.md](../creative_engineering.md) 5, [creative_split.md](../creative_split.md) 7.13, TODO `creativesplit/engineering #10`)
